<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH INSURER SEES NO 1996 PROFIT.</title>
<headline>CZECH INSURER SEES NO 1996 PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech insurer Ceska Pojistovna a.s. said on Thursday that it does not expect to record any 1996 profit and could post a loss after recording net profit of 413 million crowns last year.</p>
<p>&quot;It should not be a dramatically negative number,&quot; Pojistovna's General Director Ladislva Bartonicek told a news conference after an extraordinary general meeting.</p>
</text>
